---

---

<section id="runs" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <p class="neon-script text-2xl" style="font-family: var(--font-serif-display)">
    ✨Where the shine happens✨
  </p>
  <h2
    class="mt-2 font-display text-5xl tracking-wide uppercase sm:text-7xl"
    style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
  >
    Weekly Runs
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
    {/* THURSDAY, the Pilsen's Gym flyer: black, ovals, sparkles, blue chrome */}
    <article
      class="sticker-l group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cream/15 bg-black p-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:rotate-0"
    >
      <span class="sparkle text-xl" style="top: 8%; left: 82%">✦</span>
      <span class="sparkle text-sm" style="top: 78%; left: 8%; animation-delay: 1.2s">✦</span>
      <span class="sparkle text-base" style="top: 30%; left: 6%; animation-delay: 0.5s">✧</span>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="flyer-pill text-cream">Every Thursday</span>
        <span class="flyer-pill text-guapo-yellow">6:30 PM</span>
      </div>

      <h3
        class="mt-8 font-display text-4xl tracking-wide text-ice uppercase drop-shadow-[0_0_18px_rgba(158,210,255,0.6)]"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
      >
        Pilsen’s Gym<br />Run Club
      </h3>
      <p class="neon-script neon-yellow mt-2 text-xl">Los Guapos</p>

      <p class="mt-5 text-cream/75">
        Meet at the front desk. 1-mile walk, 3-mile run, or 5-mile options.
        Pick your lane and roll out with the familia. Rain or shine:
        <em>“unless it’s radioactive outside.”</em>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm tracking-widest text-cream/50 uppercase">📍 Pilsen’s Gym · meet at the front desk</p>
    </article>

    {/* SATURDAY, the acid 06/27 flyer: purple wash, big numerals */}
    <article
      class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cream/15 p-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2"
      style="background:
        radial-gradient(500px 300px at 80% 10%, rgba(228, 22, 212, 0.35), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(500px 320px at 10% 90%, rgba(158, 210, 255, 0.25), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(160deg, #3a1c72 0%, #241147 55%, #12081f 100%);"
    >
      <span class="sparkle text-xl" style="top: 12%; left: 8%; animation-delay: 0.8s">✦</span>
      <span class="sparkle text-base" style="top: 70%; left: 88%; animation-delay: 1.7s">✧</span>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="flyer-pill text-cream">Saturdays</span>
        <span class="flyer-pill text-neon">~7:30 AM</span>
      </div>

      <p
        class="mt-6 font-display text-7xl leading-none tracking-tight text-cream uppercase"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
      >
        SAT<span class="text-hot">✦</span>
      </p>
      <h3
        class="font-display text-3xl tracking-wide text-cream uppercase"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
      >
        Let’s Run Together
      </h3>

      <p class="mt-5 text-cream/80">
        The long run: 2, 4, 6, or 8-mile options (más during marathon block).
        Usually from Bittersweet, 2019 S Laflin; trail days at Swallow Cliff
        &amp; Waterfall Glen. Watch the story for this week’s spot.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm tracking-widest text-cream/60 uppercase">📍 Location varies · ✨🪩✨</p>
    </article>

    {/* FIREFLI, the yellow jacket: taxi yellow, black type, 不撓不屈 */}
    <article
      class="sticker-r bg-guapo-yellow group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8 text-night transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:rotate-0"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="flyer-pill border-night/60 text-night">Always on</span>
        <span class="flyer-pill border-night/60 text-night">Team Firefli x Guapøs</span>
      </div>

      <h3
        class="mt-8 font-display text-4xl tracking-wide uppercase"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
      >
        Guapøs
      </h3>
      <p lang="zh" class="text-xl tracking-[0.5em] font-semibold text-night/70">
        不撓不屈
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5 font-medium text-night/80">
        Indomitable. That’s the jacket, that’s the club. Every run, walk, y
        workout cuenta: stack points with the Guapøs team on Firefli.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://app.fireflifit.com/?referral=8HGEUYNBWF&name=Los+Guapos"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="mt-6 inline-block w-fit rounded-full bg-night px-6 py-3 font-display tracking-wider text-guapo-yellow uppercase transition-transform hover:scale-105"
        style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
      >
        ✨ Join the team ✨
      </a>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-12 text-center font-serif-display text-xl italic text-cream/60" style="font-family: var(--font-serif-display)">
    First time? Just show up. Someone will run (or walk) every pace with you.
    Any questions, just send us a DM! ✨🫶🏽✨
  </p>
</section>
